    "description": "Post localization path: denoise dialogue, speech-to-speech translate source\u2192target with SeamlessM4T (default eng\u2192spa), normalize, preview, and export. Swap src_lang / tgt_lang on SpeechTranslate. SeamlessM4T is CC-BY-NC-4.0 (non-commercial).",
