      "widgets": {
        "text": "Localize Dialogue (A\u2192B) \u2014 Denoise, then SeamlessM4T speech-to-speech (default eng\u2192spa). Change src_lang / tgt_lang on SpeechTranslate. speaker_id (0\u2013199) picks vocoder voice \u2014 not source clone; try other IDs if gender/timbre is wrong. Offline sample-accurate render \u00b7 Play = cached PCM. SeamlessM4T is CC-BY-NC (non-commercial)."
      }
    },
    {
